        "original_id": "f3cc548d-57aa-5e16-b7bb-5a090ceebcd1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Les Clark, Ub Iwerks, Walt Disney\n- Companies: Disney\n- Characters: Mickey Mouse, Oswald the Lucky Rabbit\n- Roles: animator, cartoonist, character designer, inventor, special effects technician\n\nFacts:\n- Ub Iwerks was born on March 24, 1901.\n- Les Clark joined Disney in 1927.\n- Les Clark was the only person besides Ub Iwerks to work on the origins of Mickey Mouse.\n- Ub Iwerks was an American animator, cartoonist, character designer, inventor, and special effects technician.\n- Ub Iwerks created Oswald the Lucky Rabbit with Walt Disney.\n- Ub Iwerks created Mickey Mouse with Walt Disney.\n- Ub Iwerks died on July 7, 1971.",
